OL,3,GNEWSAVillage with new #16,000 bus
OL,4,Ashelters loses routes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village that invested #16,00 into new
OL,7,Fbus shelters will only see them being
OL,8,Fused by school buses after its other
OL,9,Froutes have been cut.
OL,11,FPeople living in Kirtling,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, were served by the 47
OL,13,Fand 902 bus routes that took them from
OL,14,Fthe village to Newmarket, Suffolk, but
OL,15,Fthe Cambridgeshire and Peterborough
OL,16,FCombined Authority (CPCA) passed a
OL,17,Frecommendation to cut the routes.
OL,19,FThe decision was part of a bus service
OL,20,Fshake-up that could see 31 routes
OL,21,Fchanged across Cambridgeshire.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
