OL,3,GNEWSAVillage with new #16,000 bus
OL,4,Ashelters loses routes
OL,5,
OL,6,FJonny Edge, a Liberal Democrat on
OL,7,FCambridgeshire County Council, said
OL,8,Fcommunities south of Newmarket were
OL,9,Fconcerned the proposed routes "do not
OL,10,Ffully reflect the destinations" they
OL,11,Fneeded to reach.
